===Etymology===
Via other European languages, ultimately borrowed from {{bor|lv|la|India}}, itself from {{uder|lv|grc|Ἰνδία}}, from {{m|grc|Ἰνδός||Indus River}}, from {{uder|lv|peo|𐏃𐎡𐎯𐎢𐏁|tr=hi<sup>n</sup>dūš}} ({{cog|fa|هند|tr=hend}}) from {{uder|lv|sa|सिन्धु||a river, stream|tr=síndhu}}.

